# yiwet / yiwen ("one", f. / m.) as the indefinite marker before a daypart:
# "yiwet n tṣebḥit n tegrest" ("one winter morning") names no date.
# Tatoeba kab 10187915: "D yiwet n tṣebḥit icebḥen deg lexrif."
# ("It is a fine autumn morning.")  Tatoeba kab 9834352: "... yiwet n
# tṣebḥit akken deg tegrest ..." (a narrated winter morning).
yiwet
yiwen
